  message: "P4 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 9ae4abe13f; owner-requested re-check of open P4 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p4_review_11012026/graph1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Review 2026-11-01 at dev 9ae4abe13f. cmd_dead_code_maybe (cli.py:9421-9442) still builds Symbol by hand. It now also passes discovery_language/protocol_origin, but not supply_chain_tier or modifiers. Fixture with vendor/lib/server.py + app/main.py flask handlers: hand-built gives the vendored handler tier 1, rank 1.0; Symbol.from_dict gives tier 3, rank 0.354. Correction: the impact is not limited to --min-confidence > 0, because detect_entrypoints applies its own MIN_ENTRYPOINT_CONFIDENCE=0.10 floor and the size cap (_diversity_cap) by rank_score, and both run at the default. MECHANISM: A hand-written dict-to-Symbol conversion instead of the single deserializer Symbol.from_dict drops fields the consumer reads."  # 0f81
